1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:07,189
Bug 001. After Reset App State, the product button still says Remove.

2
00:00:08,158 --> 00:00:13,213
Step 1. Add the Sauce Labs Backpack to the cart.

3
00:00:13,276 --> 00:00:17,936
The cart badge shows 1, and the button now says Remove.

4
00:00:17,943 --> 00:00:23,088
Step 2. Open the menu and click Reset App State.

5
00:00:24,159 --> 00:00:33,584
Expected: the button changes back to Add to cart. Actual: the cart badge is gone, but the button still says Remove.

6
00:00:33,591 --> 00:00:38,236
Only after reloading the page does the button show Add to cart.

7
00:00:38,713 --> 00:00:42,183
Workaround: reload the page.
